    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a pause though. it feels more permanent. like the well didn't just run dry, it's like the well itself doesn't exist anymore. what's the point of trying to reconnect to something that isn't there? it just feels like i'm dragging a corpse around.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
